{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-loading","title":"资源加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/networking/resource-loading","wordCount":596,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"资源加载\">资源加载</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>浏览器解析 HTML 时按资源类型自动分配<strong>加载优先级</strong>，并通过<strong>资源提示</strong>指导网络行为：<code>preconnect</code> 提前建立连接、<code>preload</code> 提前加载当前页面关键资源、<code>prefetch</code> 低优先级预取未来页面资源。脚本通过 <code>defer</code>（保序、不阻塞）或 <code>async</code>（不保序、不阻塞）控制执行时机，图片可用 <code>loading=&quot;lazy&quot;</code> 原生懒加载。合理组合这些手段可显著改善 LCP、FCP 等指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"浏览器的资源加载策略\">浏览器的资源加载策略</h2><p>浏览器在解析 HTML 时会发现各种子资源（CSS、JS、图片、字体等），并根据资源类型和优先级安排加载顺序。理解浏览器的资源加载机制对于优化页面性能至关重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    HTML[&quot;HTML 解析&quot;]&#10;    HTML --&gt; Preload[&quot;预加载扫描器&quot;]&#10;    HTML --&gt; Priority[&quot;优先级调度&quot;]&#10;    Preload --&gt; Queue[&quot;资源加载队列&quot;]&#10;    Priority --&gt; Queue&#10;    Queue --&gt; Network[&quot;网络请求&quot;]&#10;    Network --&gt; Cache{&quot;缓存命中?&quot;}&#10;    Cache -- 是 --&gt; Use[&quot;使用缓存&quot;]&#10;    Cache -- 否 --&gt; Fetch[&quot;从服务器获取&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    HTML[\"HTML 解析\"]\n    HTML --&gt; Preload[\"预加载扫描器\"]\n    HTML --&gt; Priority[\"优先级调度\"]\n    Preload --&gt; Queue[\"资源加载队列\"]\n    Priority --&gt; Queue\n    Queue --&gt; Network[\"网络请求\"]\n    Network --&gt; Cache{\"缓存命中?\"}\n    Cache -- 是 --&gt; Use[\"使用缓存\"]\n    Cache -- 否 --&gt; Fetch[\"从服务器获取\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"资源提示-resource-hints\">资源提示（Resource Hints）</h2><p>浏览器提供了多种资源提示机制，让开发者可以指导浏览器预先执行某些网络操作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>提示类型</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>dns-prefetch</code></td>\n<td>预解析域名</td>\n<td>即将访问的第三方域名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>preconnect</code></td>\n<td>预建立连接（DNS + TCP + TLS）</td>\n<td>关键第三方资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prefetch</code></td>\n<td>低优先级预获取</td>\n<td>下一页面可能需要的资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>preload</code></td>\n<td>高优先级预加载</td>\n<td>当前页面关键资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prerender</code></td>\n<td>预渲染整个页面</td>\n<td>用户极大概率访问的页面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>modulepreload</code></td>\n<td>预加载 ES 模块</td>\n<td>动态导入的模块</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function addResourceHint(&#10;  type: &#39;dns-prefetch&#39; | &#39;preconnect&#39; | &#39;prefetch&#39; | &#39;preload&#39; | &#39;modulepreload&#39;,&#10;  href: string,&#10;  options?: { as?: string; crossOrigin?: string; type?: string },&#10;): HTMLLinkElement {&#10;  const link = document.createElement(&#39;link&#39;);&#10;  link.rel = type;&#10;  link.href = href;&#10;&#10;  if (options?.as) link.setAttribute(&#39;as&#39;, options.as);&#10;  if (options?.crossOrigin) link.crossOrigin = options.crossOrigin;&#10;  if (options?.type) link.type = options.type;&#10;&#10;  document.head.appendChild(link);&#10;  return link;&#10;}&#10;&#10;addResourceHint(&#39;preconnect&#39;, &#39;https://api.example.com&#39;, { crossOrigin: &#39;anonymous&#39; });&#10;addResourceHint(&#39;preload&#39;, &#39;/fonts/inter.woff2&#39;, { as: &#39;font&#39;, crossOrigin: &#39;anonymous&#39;, type: &#39;font/woff2&#39; });&#10;addResourceHint(&#39;prefetch&#39;, &#39;/next-page.html&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> addResourceHint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'dns-prefetch'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'preconnect'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'prefetch'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'preload'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'modulepreload'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  href</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">crossOrigin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLLinkElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> link</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'link'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  link.rel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> type;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  link.href </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> href;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (options?.as) link.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'as'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, options.as);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (options?.crossOrigin) link.crossOrigin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> options.crossOrigin;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (options?.type) link.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> options.type;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  document.head.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appendChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(link);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> link;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addResourceHint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'preconnect'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://api.example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { crossOrigin: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'anonymous'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addResourceHint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'preload'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/fonts/inter.woff2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { as: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'font'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, crossOrigin: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'anonymous'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'font/woff2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addResourceHint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'prefetch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/next-page.html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"优先级提示-priority-hints\">优先级提示（Priority Hints）</h2><p><code>fetchpriority</code> 属性允许开发者调整资源的加载优先级：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph High[&quot;高优先级&quot;]&#10;        CSS[&quot;CSS&quot;]&#10;        Font[&quot;关键字体&quot;]&#10;        LCP[&quot;LCP 图片&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Medium[&quot;中优先级&quot;]&#10;        JS[&quot;同步 JS&quot;]&#10;        Img[&quot;可见图片&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Low[&quot;低优先级&quot;]&#10;        Prefetch[&quot;prefetch&quot;]&#10;        Offscreen[&quot;屏外图片&quot;]&#10;        AsyncJS[&quot;async JS&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    High --&gt; Medium --&gt; Low\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph High[\"高优先级\"]\n        CSS[\"CSS\"]\n        Font[\"关键字体\"]\n        LCP[\"LCP 图片\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Medium[\"中优先级\"]\n        JS[\"同步 JS\"]\n        Img[\"可见图片\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Low[\"低优先级\"]\n        Prefetch[\"prefetch\"]\n        Offscreen[\"屏外图片\"]\n        AsyncJS[\"async JS\"]\n    end\n    High --&gt; Medium --&gt; Low</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function createPriorityImage(src: string, priority: &#39;high&#39; | &#39;low&#39; | &#39;auto&#39;): HTMLImageElement {&#10;  const img = document.createElement(&#39;img&#39;);&#10;  img.src = src;&#10;  img.fetchPriority = priority;&#10;  img.loading = priority === &#39;high&#39; ? &#39;eager&#39; : &#39;lazy&#39;;&#10;  return img;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const heroImage = createPriorityImage(&#39;/hero-banner.jpg&#39;, &#39;high&#39;);&#10;document.querySelector(&#39;.hero&#39;)?.appendChild(heroImage);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createPriorityImage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">src</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">priority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'auto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLImageElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> img</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'img'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  img.src </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> src;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  img.fetchPriority </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priority;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  img.loading </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> priority </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'eager'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'lazy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> img;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> heroImage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createPriorityImage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/hero-banner.jpg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.hero'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)?.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appendChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(heroImage);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>默认优先级规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源类型</th>\n<th>默认优先级</th>\n<th>可调整</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CSS（阻塞渲染）</td>\n<td>Highest</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步 <code>&lt;script&gt;</code>（head 中）</td>\n<td>High</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;script async&gt;</code></td>\n<td>Low</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;img&gt;</code>（可视区域内）</td>\n<td>High</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;img&gt;</code>（可视区域外）</td>\n<td>Low</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fetch()</code></td>\n<td>High</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字体（CSS 引用）</td>\n<td>High</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;link rel=&quot;prefetch&quot;&gt;</code></td>\n<td>Lowest</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"脚本加载策略\">脚本加载策略</h2><p><code>&lt;script&gt;</code> 标签的不同属性组合决定了脚本的加载和执行行为：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Normal[&quot;普通 script&quot;]&#10;        N1[&quot;HTML 解析&quot;] --&gt; N2[&quot;暂停&quot;]&#10;        N2 --&gt; N3[&quot;下载脚本&quot;]&#10;        N3 --&gt; N4[&quot;执行脚本&quot;]&#10;        N4 --&gt; N5[&quot;继续解析&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Async[&quot;async script&quot;]&#10;        A1[&quot;HTML 解析继续&quot;]&#10;        A2[&quot;并行下载脚本&quot;]&#10;        A1 --&gt; A3[&quot;解析中...&quot;]&#10;        A2 --&gt; A4[&quot;下载完成 → 暂停解析&quot;]&#10;        A4 --&gt; A5[&quot;执